What is thread?
--> a thread is a sub part of the process.

--> a flow of execution in the process is called a thread.

--> an independent path of execution in the process is called as thread.

--> a thread is a light weight process.

What is multi-threading : 

--> executing more than one thread simultaneously in the process is called 
    as multi-threading.
advantages of multi-threading
-----------------------------
--> multi-threading reduces response time and improves performance.
